{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：医疗行业数据与主题变化观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">西门子医疗在7月31日公布<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025</span>/26财年第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>业绩。这份财报最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的地方，不是又一次下调收入指引本身，而是指引调整与订单数据同时出现：可比收入增长指引从+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.5%</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.0%</span>降至+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.5%</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.0%</span>，但设备book-to-bill达到1.27。Bernstein在财报后维持跑赢评级。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">指引下调的根源在Diagnostics业务。该板块第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>可比收入同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.5%</span>，中国市场的结构性变化是主要仍在调整，VBP相关的市场扰动持续影响IVD业务；美洲和EMEA地区则因传统平台产品下滑而出现中个位数下降，亚太日本区的增长不足以抵消其他区域的仍在调整。Diagnostics的调整后EBIT利润率从去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.2%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.1%</span>，收入下降带来的盈利减少、业务组合不利和汇率谨慎效应，超过了转型项目带来的成本削减和关税退款。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX9wLrlSgYw9t0xUTrgzgMyr4pTibYaSAMyQPiahv75aiaBp23xh62PuslNgbqtQ0sAlDP0Z25EvcqAcXYfCD8Ypl3NMrK5cWLMK4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">跨境贸易与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">公司同时调整了两项指引。可比收入增长指引下调至+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.5%</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.0%</span>，比此前市场预期的+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.5%</span>低约75个基点；调整后EPS指引则从€2.20-2.30上调至€2.35-2.45，原因是美国IEEPA关税退款带来的一次性收益。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>指出，收入指引的下调幅度大于市场预期，而EPS指引的上调完全来自非经营性项目。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 收入指引下调和EPS指引上调同时出现，容易让读者误读为基本面<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。实际上，剔除关税退款后，调整后EPS约为€2.24，与旧指引区间基本一致。看这份财报，需要把一次性收益和经营性趋势分开。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUicdf4eRIT4LeDFqiaUOEmvFaLndibXT5MAKq18XYLonQxtz2mlq9TnTsszHrOxbLXoMuOjkbtM5EZicjicibnCXsTgWcCBZoxib2tQM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层在电话会上提前披露了下一财年的EPS不确定性来源：税率正常化、再融资成本上升，以及与西门子集团分离相关的增量独立运营成本。这三项合计可能带来约€0.10-0.15的EPS逆风。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，关税退款和其他缓解措施、Imaging领域高端技术的持续采用，以及Precision Therapy的动能，能够部分对冲这些不确定性。该机构预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>/27财年调整后EPS增长约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，基于剔除关税退款后的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025</span>/26财年调整后EPS €2.24计算。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXOUlpOibb357UAic6IGd2UEKjiaMq0RFtPrFRWylssniaiajxlIbez4YQ4as1iazwMLLSwG7xguolpYHN6nyqlR9gyfTsh7sR8VSXf4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.设备业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>设备book-to-bill达到1.27，这一数字在收入增速节奏变化的背景下值得单独看待。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，订单数据表明Imaging和Precision Therapy的核心需求仍然稳固，收入指引下调主要反映Diagnostics的结构性问题，而非整体需求走弱。第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>管理层给出分板块指引：Imaging预计<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>至高个位数增长，部分受益于MR收入从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">Q3</span>递延至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">Q4</span>；Precision Therapy预计保持高个位数增长；Diagnostics则预计再次出现中个位数下降。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">&lt;p style=\"color:#999999;font-size:12px;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWEJ1kMWYL7ZNZA5HbKMiat56fhM2zWYI423qnicr7zxTN1wS5hqAc35ibF3RsIujpNcy31ialf0aE6dpOM0OkK7ib8QuldKUBREicKs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 15-Bernstein-Siemens Healthineers AG-SHL.GR -Healthineers- Q3 2025 26 saw another guidance cut due to China Diagnostics but order book shows strength in core business-260804</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
